    "canonicalType": "KnowledgeStatement",
    "label": "被控对象传感器的模拟输出经采样后在 A/D 转换器中转换为数字量；计算离散误差信号；利用差分方程逼近 D_c(s)；计算结果 u(kT) 经 D/A 和 ZOH 转换为连续信号 u(t)。",
    "aliases": [],
    "description": "The analog output of the plant sensor is sampled and converted to a digital number in the A/D converter; the discrete error signal is computed; difference equations approximate D_c(s); the result u(kT) is converted to continuous u(t) by D/A and ZOH.",
